{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"お久しぶりです。\nブログお待たせしてしまって\nすみません、、、。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/09/2147589/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"(.久しぶりに乃木ジャーじゃない\n写真を投下)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さて！\nまだまだ\n絶賛プリンシパル中です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"侍女２"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エリザベート役"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"に出演させていただくことが\n出来ました。\nありがとうございます。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"個人的に、\nエリザベート役は\nやってみたかったので\n演じられて嬉しかったです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"登場シーンでお客さんから\n「Fu～～♪」って聞こえて\n幸せだったなー(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりに２幕に出られて\n演技って楽しいなと\n改めて思いました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、やっぱり私は立候補した役を\nやりたいです。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/09/2147589/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ってなわけで\nプリンシパルもいよいよ\n折り返し地点を迎えました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"1幕に苦戦していますが、\n残りの公演も楽しみたいと思います。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いつもコメントとかありがとう！\nとっても嬉しいし\n活力になってます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/09/2147589/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/09/2147589/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは！\n今日はこの辺で(=ﾟωﾟ)ﾉ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また更新します"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/mai.shinuchi/img/mai.shinuchi/img/2014/06/09/2147589/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"眞衣"}],"source":"archive"}